{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p065a","title":"桓阶请本月二十九日受禅","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p065a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"桓阶请本月二十九日受禅","evidence":["wendi-e-p065a-q"]},{"id":"wendi-a-p066-approval","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"曹丕令准所请受禅日期。","evidence":["wendi-q-p066-approval"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0395","role":"奏请","evidence":["wendi-e-p065a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年十月，所请日期二十九日","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年十月，所请日期二十九日"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p065a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p065a-q","source_order":[2,178,"P065a"],"order":553}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0395","name":"桓阶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p065a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ab4d5a4ce5d8335d8db5","layer":"pei","quote":"于是尚书令桓阶等奏曰：“今汉氏之命已四至，而陛下前后固辞。臣等伏以为上帝之临圣德，期运之隆大魏，斯岂数载？《传》称周之有天下，非甲子之朝；殷之去帝位，非牧野之日也。故《诗》序商汤，追本玄王之至；述姬周，上录后稷之生。是以受命既固，厥德不回。汉氏衰废，行次已绝；三辰垂其征，史官著其验；耆老记先古之占，百姓协歌谣之声。陛下应天受禅，当速即坛场，柴燎上帝；诚不宜久停神器，拒亿兆之愿。臣辄下太史令择元辰：今月二十九日，可登坛受命。请诏三公、群卿，具条礼仪别奏。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":229},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-p066-approval","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b7fd59443bd9784e3a15","layer":"pei","quote":"令曰：“可。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":7}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
